WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.760
Timetable: this week's sessions in your calendar and the class list; make-up sessions and cancellations are done here too.

2
00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:11.650
Review the "Weekly timetable".

3
00:00:12.205 --> 00:00:20.400
For an extra session, click "Extra / make-up session"; to cancel, open the session and click "Cancel session".

4
00:00:20.951 --> 00:00:27.940
Tell the whole class with "Tell the class"; "Send the timetable" sends them the timetable.

5
00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:35.250
With "No sessions on public holidays" on, public holidays have no sessions; add the make-up yourself.
